# pstack model configuration. One line per role. Delete a line to fall back to the skill default.
# `inherit-parent` or `auto` as a value: the role runs on the parent chat model (omit Task `model`). Alias entries in a panel list still count toward its fan-out.
# This repo-committed rule IS the `pstack-models.mdc` rule. Skills that name `~/.cursor/rules/pstack-models.mdc` mean this file; cloud VMs have no ~/.cursor/rules.
# pstack is vendored at `.cursor/skills/pstack/`. poteto-mode lives at `.cursor/skills/pstack/poteto-mode/SKILL.md`; give that absolute path to every `poteto-agent`, and do not search ~/.cursor/plugins/.
